### auth/verify-account

PATCH http://localhost:3000/auth/verify-account
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "[EMAIL_ADDRESS]",
    "code": "158364"
}


### auth/login

POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "[EMAIL_ADDRESS]",
    "password": "[PASSWORD]"
}

### auth/logout

POST http://localhost:3000/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refreshToken": ""
}